t.&lt;br&gt;Chart_Passport tab: every chart, what it shows, its filter, the table and the source tabs. Both are rebuilt on every pipeline run." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5DA;align=left;spacingLeft=16;fontSize=13;fontColor=#5F6C77;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="842" width="1420" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>